    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Finally, we briefly summarise the link between local and global utility in the monotone case, which too is completely analogous to the previous subsection. The expression for maximal expected monotone quadratic utility from Proposition 2.3 and Theorem 2.16 translates to"
