    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "where we may interpret Kmmv = B2gmmv◦(λˆ·R) as the cumulative maximal local squared MHR. Using the conversion between the (monotone) Hansen and the (monotone) Sharpe ratio, we also obtain"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
